{"type":"message","id":"3b8e0505","parentId":"e4ff2ae1","timestamp":"2026-04-24T10:18:22.102Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vTKSnT5qL0zED3hFSbfbDg1V","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"INSTALLED=2.2.1\nTARGET=x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\nEXPECTED=b81f33345d6690911b19e2c0960927b64ee159b72f17c11b0c278acbd47d9cdb\nACTUAL=b81f33345d6690911b19e2c0960927b64ee159b72f17c11b0c278acbd47d9cdb\n\n=== HELP TOKEN SEARCH ===\nSearch for tokens by name, symbol, or address\n\nUsage: onchainos token search [OPTIONS] --query <QUERY>\n\nOptions:\n      --base-url <BASE_URL>  Backend service URL (overrides config)\n      --query <QUERY>        Search keyword (name, symbol, or contract address)\n      --chain <CHAIN>        Chain: ethereum, solana, base, bsc, polygon, arbitrum, sui, etc\n      --chains <CHAINS>      Chains to search (comma-separated, e.g. \"ethereum,solana\"). Defaults to global --chain if set, otherwise \"1,501\"\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n\n=== HELP MARKET KLINE ===\nGet K-line / candlestick data\n\nUsage: onchainos market kline [OPTIONS] --address <ADDRESS>\n\nOptions:\n      --address <ADDRESS>    Token contract address\n      --base-url <BASE_URL>  Backend service URL (overrides config)\n      --bar <BAR>            Bar size: 1s, 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1H, 4H, 1D, 1W, etc [default: 1H]\n      --limit <LIMIT>        Number of data points (max 299) [default: 100]\n      --chain <CHAIN>        Chain\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n\n=== HELP TOKEN PRICE-INFO ===\nGet detailed price info (price, market cap, liquidity, volume, 24h change)\n\nUsage: onchainos token price-info [OPTIONS] --address <ADDRESS>\n\nOptions:\n      --address <ADDRESS>    Token contract address\n      --base-url <BASE_URL>  Backend service URL (overrides config)\n      --chain <CHAIN>        Chain\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"wild-mist","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"INSTALLED=2.2.1\nTARGET=x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\nEXPECTED=b81f33345d6690911b19e2c0960927b64ee159b72f17c11b0c278acbd47d9cdb\nACTUAL=b81f33345d6690911b19e2c0960927b64ee159b72f17c11b0c278acbd47d9cdb\n\n=== HELP TOKEN SEARCH ===\nSearch for tokens by name, symbol, or address\n\nUsage: onchainos token search [OPTIONS] --query <QUERY>\n\nOptions:\n      --base-url <BASE_URL>  Backend service URL (overrides config)\n      --query <QUERY>        Search keyword (name, symbol, or contract address)\n      --chain <CHAIN>        Chain: ethereum, solana, base, bsc, polygon, arbitrum, sui, etc\n      --chains <CHAINS>      Chains to search (comma-separated, e.g. \"ethereum,solana\"). Defaults to global --chain if set, otherwise \"1,501\"\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n\n=== HELP MARKET KLINE ===\nGet K-line / candlestick data\n\nUsage: onchainos market kline [OPTIONS] --address <ADDRESS>\n\nOptions:\n      --address <ADDRESS>    Token contract address\n      --base-url <BASE_URL>  Backend service URL (overrides config)\n      --bar <BAR>            Bar size: 1s, 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1H, 4H, 1D, 1W, etc [default: 1H]\n      --limit <LIMIT>        Number of data points (max 299) [default: 100]\n      --chain <CHAIN>        Chain\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n\n=== HELP TOKEN PRICE-INFO ===\nGet detailed price info (price, market cap, liquidity, volume, 24h change)\n\nUsage: onchainos token price-info [OPTIONS] --address <ADDRESS>\n\nOptions:\n      --address <ADDRESS>    Token contract address\n      --base-url <BASE_URL>  Backend service URL (overrides config)\n      --chain <CHAIN>        Chain\n  -h, --help                 Print help\n","name":"set mkdir"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777025902098}}
