{"type":"message","id":"37bc51ff","parentId":"b94a452f","timestamp":"2026-04-24T10:24:09.207Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering monitoring options**\n\nThe user is looking for help with monitoring something. I think a cron job could work, but I need to ask for specifics since exact timing and conditions are important. If I can get clear thresholds and duration, I could set up a reminder or cron job. I might suggest asking for what conditions they want to trigger the reminders, like when it goes above or below a certain level. It's crucial to be honest about not being able to continuously monitor without proper tools.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，我能帮你盯，但先说实话：我现在不能像交易所告警那样直接订阅实时盘口。\n\n我能做的靠谱方案有两种：\n\n1. 你定条件，我帮你定时查\n比如你告诉我：\n- 跌破 0.0184 提醒你\n- 反弹到 0.0196 附近提醒你\n- 30 分钟看一次，盯到今晚 12 点\n\n我就按这个给你设提醒/轮询节奏。\n\n2. 你随时丢一句“现在怎么样”\n我马上按同样口径继续看，给你一句话判断。\n\n如果你想让我现在开始盯，直接回我这类格式就行：\n\n- 盯 KAT\n- 30 分钟查一次\n- 跌破 0.0184 提醒\n- 上冲 0.0196 也提醒\n- 盯到今晚 12 点\n\n或者更简单一点：\n“每30分钟帮我看一次，跌破0.0184或者到0.0196就提醒我”\n\n你一句话定规则，我就给你安排。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":958,"output":462,"cacheRead":64256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65676,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777026239594,"responseId":"resp_0a5a5ada57f939cf0169eb44c14f5881919ac3e3e59f92f8d8"}}
